    <label>Yamato Fence</label>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass>
    <category>Building</category>
	<drawerType>MapMeshAndRealTime</drawerType>
    <description>The fence is a workpiece that has the effect of preventing invasion of people and animals and blindfolding.
Yamato-Fence is a fence stretched from the front and back with alternating plates one by one.
I open a gap by passing a crosspiece between the boards.
By doing so, it is a simple fence that blocks the line of sight and also passes the wind.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Building/Fence/WA-Fence-Yamatobei</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <linkType>Transmitter</linkType>
